{room, key=street_vice_port, name=Vice Harbor
    {attrib, output=true, tags=tested }

    {attrib, tags=navigation
        output={@
Behind you is a moving ramp going up.
6 streets extend off into the distance.
One going west toward the waterfront.
One going northwest toward the Business District.
One going north toward the park.
One going northeast toward the Art District.
One going east toward the industrial area.
And one going southeast along the water.
        }
    }

    {enter_message
        output={@
You are next to a major street in the downtown district of a city called Vice Harbor.
<?[invite_chip]parent = [player]?>

A young woman is standing nearby. She nods at you and says:
There's a great cafe in the park north of here. Best coffee.
</?>
        }

        {logic, name=Shellspace street view tested, tags=!_test
            logic={@
                ?[self]((tested)) = 'true'
            }
        }
    }

    {look
        {message
            output={@

You look around.
You are next to a major street in the downtown district of a city called Vice Harbor.
<?[invite_chip]parent = [player]?>

A young woman is standing nearby. She nods at you and says:
There's a great cafe in the park north of here. Best coffee.
</?>
            }
        }
    }


    {inject, logic=/nav.inj }
    {inject, logic=/look.inj }


    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_up))
        {move, logic=shellspace_port, tags=[player]
            output={@
You step on the ramp and it returns you to the port.
            }
        }

        {set, logic=[switch_hustler]parent, tags=!_limbo }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_west))
        {move, logic=waterfront_west, tags=[player]
            output={@
You go west.
            }
        }

        {set, logic=[switch_hustler]parent, tags=!_limbo }
    }

    {input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((go_north_west))
        {move, logic=business_northwest, tags=[player]
            output={@
You go north west.
            }
        }

        {set, logic=[switch_hustler]parent, tags=!_limbo }

        {logic
            logic={@
                ?[invite_chip]parent = [player]
            }
            output={@

You should go west, along the waterfront. That's what the man you met suggested.

            }
        }
    }



    {dev_note, tags=Clue
        output={@
If the player has the invite chip - from the cruise...

The robot tells the player the access password:
fidelis
        }
    }
}
